---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import StudioImage from "../../components/StudioImage.astro";
import Teachers from "../../components/Teachers.astro";
import teachingOnlineImage from '/public/images/about/teaching-online-1600.webp';
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" page="about" title="About – Studio Sun & Sea">
  <h1>About Studio Sun & Sea</h1>

  <section>
    <h2>Our Approach</h2>
    <p>Studio Sun & Sea is a space for mindful movement, breath, and presence. Rooted in traditional yoga foundations and informed by modern movement science, our classes offer a grounded, accessible, and supportive practice for all levels.</p>
    <p>Whether in person or online, the focus is always the same: cultivating awareness, strength, and ease - on and off the mat.</p>
  </section>

  <Teachers lang="en" />

  <section>
    <h2>What “Sun & Sea” Means</h2>
    <p>The name Studio Sun & Sea reflects the qualities of warmth, clarity, and fluidity. It is inspired by the Dalmatian coast, where I have personal roots and where the rhythm of sun and sea naturally invites balance and presence.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How We Teach</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Clear, steady guidance</li>
      <li>Accessible sequencing for all levels</li>
      <li>Breath-led movement</li>
      <li>Functional alignment and mindful strength</li>
      <li>Space for rest, reflection, and grounding</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Our Values</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Inclusivity and accessibility for all bodies and backgrounds</li>
      <li>Personal responsibility for safety and needs</li>
      <li>Connection, kindness, and community</li>
      <li>Clarity, presence, and mindful practice</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Where We Teach Our Online-Only Classes</h2>
    <p>
      The online-only classes at Studio Sun & Sea are taught from a quiet, light-filled room designed for clarity, focus, and ease of movement. Arranged to support presence rather than performance, this is where each class is prepared and taught: a calm, grounded environment that reflects the same values we bring into practice. Even through the screen, the intention is the same — to offer a space that feels steady, human, and genuinely supportive.
    </p>
    <p>
      We offer online classes for those who prefer to practice from the comfort of their own space. These sessions are designed to be accessible and engaging, providing the same quality of instruction as our in-person classes.
      <StudioImage
        src={teachingOnlineImage}
        alt="Online Teaching Space"
      />
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
